#. /TRANSLATORS: Positive response, casual
#: src/FortuneLabel.vala:67
msgid "Yep!"
msgstr "Да!"

#. /TRANSLATORS: Positive response
#: src/FortuneLabel.vala:72
msgid "Absolutely!"
